# Seq pattern: process head; payload dict p has p.head and p.tail fields.
# T-1154: [Seq h t] no longer binds h/t; use [Seq.Cons p] to bind the payload dict.
# Only p.head is accessed in the body — the tail is not forced.
[match [seq 10 [seq 20 [seq 30 []]]]
  [case [let p] [Seq.Cons p] [+ p.head 5]]
  ...:                       0]
=== out
Int(15)
